{
  "title": {
    "en": "Movement Tuning",
    "zh-Hans": "动作速度调整"
  },
  "description": {
    "en": "Faster walking, running, sprinting, dodges, jumps, wall runs, ladders and attacks: one speed for every move, or a speed for each. Higher jumps. A left stick curve that lets you walk, stick dead zones, auto sprint.",
    "zh-Hans": "更快的行走、奔跑、冲刺、闪避、跳跃、跑墙、爬梯和攻击：所有动作使用同一速度，或为每个动作单独设置速度。跳得更高。左摇杆曲线让行走更容易，可调整摇杆死区，并支持自动冲刺。"
  },
  "version": "1.0.1",
  "settings": [
    {
      "key": "Enabled",
      "type": "toggle",
      "label": {
        "en": "Enabled",
        "zh-Hans": "启用"
      },
      "help": {
        "en": "Off: every move and attack plays at the game's own speed, jumps keep the game's height, and the sticks and the sprint work as in the game.",
        "zh-Hans": "关闭：所有动作和攻击恢复游戏原有速度，跳跃恢复游戏原有高度，摇杆和冲刺恢复游戏原有设定。"
      },
      "default": true
    },
