      "help": {
        "en": "Global: same speed as the Global row. 1.0 is the game's own speed, 2.5 two and a half times as fast. Chained dodges play faster. A single dodge lasts as long as before and covers more ground. Global stops at 2.5 here too: any faster and the next dodge can't be chained in time.",
        "zh-Hans": "全局：与“全局”行的速度相同。1.0 为游戏原有速度，2.5 为 2.5 倍速度。连续闪避会更快。单次闪避持续时间不变，但移动距离更远。设为“全局”时同样最高 2.5：再快就来不及接上下一次闪避。"
      },
