    {
      "key": "LeftStick",
      "type": "choice",
      "label": {
        "en": "Left stick",
        "zh-Hans": "左摇杆"
      },
      "help": {
        "en": "How the left stick sets your pace. Game: you run from about halfway. Smooth: you walk until about three quarters of the stick, at a speed that follows your push. Custom: the four rows below.",
        "zh-Hans": "左摇杆如何决定移动速度。游戏原有：推到约一半即开始奔跑。平滑：推到约四分之三前都是行走，速度随推动幅度变化。自定义：使用下方四项设置。"
      },
      "default": "Custom",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "Game",
          "label": {
            "en": "Game",
            "zh-Hans": "游戏原有"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "Smooth",
          "label": {
            "en": "Smooth",
            "zh-Hans": "平滑"
          }
        },
        {
          "value": "Custom",
          "label": {
            "en": "Custom",
            "zh-Hans": "自定义"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "LeftDeadZone",
      "type": "number",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 25,
      "step": 1,
      "default": 4,
      "label": {
        "en": "Left dead zone",
        "zh-Hans": "左摇杆死区"
      },
      "help": {
        "en": "Custom only. How much of the stick's travel, in percent, does nothing. The game's is 25. At 0, a worn stick can move your character by itself.",
        "zh-Hans": "仅在“自定义”模式下有效。摇杆行程中不起作用的百分比。游戏原有为 25。设为 0 时，磨损的摇杆可能让角色自行移动。"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "RunPoint",
      "type": "number",
      "min": 45,
      "max": 95,
      "step": 1,
      "default": 80,
      "label": {
        "en": "Run point",
        "zh-Hans": "奔跑起点"
      },
      "help": {
        "en": "Custom only. How far you push the stick, in percent of its travel, before you run. The game's is about 57.",
        "zh-Hans": "仅在“自定义”模式下有效。摇杆推到行程的百分之多少开始奔跑。游戏原有约为 57。"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "SlowestWalk",
      "type": "number",
      "min": 30,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 5,
      "default": 30,
      "label": {
        "en": "Slowest walk",
        "zh-Hans": "最慢行走"
      },
      "help": {
        "en": "Custom only. Your speed at the lightest push, in percent of the game's walk; the run starts slower too. 100: the game's speeds at any push.",
        "zh-Hans": "仅在“自定义”模式下有效。轻推摇杆时的速度，为游戏原有行走速度的百分比；奔跑起步也会相应放慢。100：任何推动幅度都使用游戏原有速度。"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "StickCurve",
      "type": "number",
      "min": 0.5,
      "max": 3,
      "step": 0.05,
      "default": 0.5,
      "label": {
        "en": "Curve",
        "zh-Hans": "曲线"
      },
      "help": {
        "en": "Custom only. 1: the speed grows evenly with your push. Higher: more of the stick's travel for the slow speeds. Under 1: the speed rises quickly from a light push.",
        "zh-Hans": "仅在“自定义”模式下有效。1：速度随推动幅度均匀增加。更高：更多摇杆行程用于低速。低于 1：轻推即可快速提速。"
      }
